            "source_segment_index": 2218,
            "start_ms": 4144940,
            "end_ms": 4147575,
            "text": "当夜预言家验证十二号玩家为狼人身份。"
          },
          {
            "index": 2219,
            "source_segment_index": 2219,
            "start_ms": 4148020,
            "end_ms": 4148360,
            "text": "第二天，"
          },
          {
            "index": 2220,
            "source_segment_index": 2220,
            "start_ms": 4148360,
            "end_ms": 4151180,
            "text": "八天五号预言家触将警徽移交至十一号舞者。"
          },
          {
            "index": 2221,
            "source_segment_index": 2221,
            "start_ms": 4151220,
            "end_ms": 4153270,
            "text": "八号狼人自爆入夜，"
          },
          {
            "index": 2222,
            "source_segment_index": 2222,
            "start_ms": 4153290,
            "end_ms": 4159370,
            "text": "舞者共舞的对象为九号白神十号平民和十一号舞者假面证，"
          },
          {
            "index": 2223,
            "source_segment_index": 2223,
            "start_ms": 4159370,
            "end_ms": 4161530,
            "text": "十一号造武师给十一号舞者扣了面具，"
          },
          {
