            "source_segment_index": 2228,
            "start_ms": 4171180,
            "end_ms": 4173480,
            "text": "这里是京城大赛第二十一季口泣奇谈。"
          },
          {
            "index": 2229,
            "source_segment_index": 2229,
            "start_ms": 4173480,
            "end_ms": 4174040,
            "text": "各位大宝师们。"
          },
          {
